---
import Baselayout from "../layouts/baselayout.astro";
---

<Baselayout>
  <div id="content" class="mt-20 mx-6">
    <h1 class="text-6xl">What about Glenn?</h1>
    <h2 class="text-3xl text-gray-400 font-light mb-10">
      Its always <em>about you</em>, never <em>how are you</em> 😭
    </h2>
    <p>
      Hi I'm Glenn Freeman. I am a non-traditional student and this is my second
      attempt at college 😱
    </p>

    <h3>Origins</h3>
    <p>
      I am originally from Griffin and went to Clayton State University for my
      first time around at college. Now I currently reside in Douglasville and
      commute around an hour to class 🙃
    </p>

    <h3>College</h3>
    <p>
      I am a Software Engineering major. The reason I like taking classes in
      person is that I have ADHD and that makes online classes more difficult
      for me to grasp the material as I usually need guidance.
    </p>

    <h3>Future</h3>
    <p>
      Career wise I would love to become a Software Developer. I am not too sure
      of what particular niche I fit into yet, but the act of coding brings me
      joy, even in this AI heavy future.
    </p>

    <h3>Hobbies</h3>
    <p>
      Hobbies I enjoy are: gaming (Tabletop and Electronic), 3D printing, Art
      (generative art and the likes using programing and GIMP), and finally I
      dabble in indie game development.
    </p>

    <h3>Mental Health</h3>
    <p>
      One other thing I would like everyone who gets this far to know is, your
      mental health is important. The reason I am doing a second attempt at
      college is that my first time I had to drop out due to the undiagnosed
      ADHD. It caused me much anxiety, that when untreated turned into
      agoraphobia and depression. It wasn't a great time. The good news is, we
      have resources available to us as students to address these types of
      issues, for FREE! I highly recommend taking some time to just sit with
      yourself and ask if you feel optimal when it comes to your emotions. Yes
      school is stressful but if you start to get overwhelmed or burnt out, I
      will make a strong bet that seeing <a
        href="https://campus.kennesaw.edu/current-students/student-affairs/wellbeing/counseling/index.php"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="link link-hover">CAPS</a
      > can help you.
    </p>

    <p>
      I could go on and on about taking care of your mental health, but suffice
      to say, "ain't nobody reading all that." I just wish you all the best, you
      got this!
    </p>
  </div>
</Baselayout>
<style>
  h3 {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }
  p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  a::after {
    content: " ↗";
    font-size: 1.1em;
  }
  a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
